all/stainless-steel-pump53584346116.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Stainless Steel Pump</h1>\n<p>stainless steel pump JIADI PUMPS has been operating in the stainless steel pump industry for 25 years and is recognized globally as one of the leading companies in this sector. JIADI PUMPS produce more than 100,000 motor-driven water pumps each month enabling the company to offer customers a...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52489227\"/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270844335173357.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>stainless steel pump</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270844364947304.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>JIADI PUMPS has been operating in the stainless steel pump industry for 25 years and is recognized globally as one of the leading companies in this sector. JIADI PUMPS produce more than 100,000 motor-driven water pumps each month enabling the company to offer customers a complete line of products that meet even the most specific requirements, whilst ensuring the highest degree of reliability.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><p><strong>Brand: </strong>JIADI</p><p><strong>Motor model type:</strong> 6SP (D)46</p><p><strong>Motor power: </strong>4kw-22kw / 5.5hp-30hp</p><p><strong>Phase:</strong> Single phase/ Three phase</p><p><strong>Voltage:</strong> 220V-240V/ 380-415V~50Hz</p><p><strong>Well diameter：</strong>&gt;150mm (6”)</p><p><strong>Speed:</strong> 2850 rpm</p><p><strong>Pump length:</strong> 1274-3030 m</p><p><strong>Q max: </strong>72 (m³/h)</p><p><strong>Motor casing:</strong> Stainless steel</p><p><strong>Insulation class:</strong> F</p><p><strong>Protection grade: </strong>IP68</p><p><strong>Highest temperature of liquid: </strong>35℃</p><p><strong>NEMA Standard</strong></p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270847468102905.jpg\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Copper Motor:<br/><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270849099878347.jpg\" title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·100% pure wire<br/>·Lower temperature and longer lifespan for the motor</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Outlet, suction chamber and oil chamber: <br/><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270849236931980.jpg\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·Different materials available：Stainless steel / Copper / Iron</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Impeller: </p><p style=\"text-align:left;\"><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270849358726526.jpg\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p style=\"text-align:left;\">·Stainless steel impeller and diffuser, dust proof</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Mechanical Seal:<br/><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270849568497862.jpg\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·No oil-leakage<br/>·water and sand proof</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Rotor Shaft:<br/><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270850076936334.jpg\" title=\"image019(001).jpg\"/> <br/>·The shaft surface which is smooth can protect the mechanical seal against wearing</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Stud/Nut/Screws： <br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270850251005718.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image021(001).jpg\"/><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270850335912047.jpg\" title=\"image023(001).jpg\"/></p><p>·304 Stainless steel <br/>·Rust protection</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>1. Agricultural or other irrigation</p><p>2. Water supply for livestock</p><p>3. Garden Fountains</p><p>4. Home Supply</p><p>5. Various water treatment systems</p><p>6. Large Scale Watering System for Commercial etc.</p><p><strong>5. How to get a proper and right quotation</strong></p><p>Please confirm more details, then we will send you price list.</p><p></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"102\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"> </p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Browse our products list</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"302\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">what the water pumps head<br/>\n      what the water pumps water capacity        <br/>\n      any request about the borehole diameter <br/>\n      how about the voltage, 380v or 220v<br/>\n      what the material, cast iron or stainless steel</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"164\"><p> </p><p>Then we    will offer you the corresponding product and price</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>6. Company Profile</strong></p><p>We are designer and manufacturer of pumps for the water supply in many constructions, agricultural usage and so on. 25 years’ experience enables us to ensure our customers an extremely reliable and professional service. Our products including submersible screw pump, multistage pump, drainage pump and so on are manufactured entirely at our sites in Weenling, Taihzou, Zhejiang.</p><p><img alt=\"image025(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270852263453603.jpg\" title=\"image025(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>7. Why choose us</strong></p><p>1. Experienced slate products supplier;</p><p>2. Professional design team and sales department for your service;</p><p>3. Factory recognized by 'CE/ISO9001' and so on;</p><p>4. 7*24 service for you, all the question will be answered ASAP within 24hours.</p><p>5. Perfect pre- in- after service will be offered to you.</p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: Can I have a sample order for electric motor? Can the sample be free?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, sample orders are welcomed to test and check quality. Mixed samples are acceptable. Owing to the high value of electric motor, you are expected to pay the sample charge and freight.</p><p><strong>2. Q: How do you check all the goods in the production line?</strong></p><p>A: We have spot inspection and finished product inspection. We check the goods when they go into next step production procedure. At length, we well carefully tested each product.</p><p><strong>3. Q: What is the difference of SP series pump?</strong></p><p>A: SP serried pumps’ housing, impeller, shaft, diffuser and so on are all made from stainless steel. This is for customers with special requirements.</p><p><strong>4. Q: How about the MOQ?</strong></p><p>A: Usually, it is 50 PCS for each model. But sample order is highly welcomed.</p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: stainless steel pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/submersible-pump-impeller-design\"><img alt=\"Submersible Pump Impeller Design\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-pump-impeller-design44280348583a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/submersible-pump-impeller-design\">Submersible Pump Impeller Design</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/100qjd-4-submersible-water-pump/submersible-pu